reak:break-all;margin:0px\"> </span></span></span><br></font></div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s the code I am running: </div><div><br></div><div>(fit_pb = cfa(m_pb, <br>              sample.cov=dim_pb3,<br>              sample.nobs=330,<br>               ordered = TRUE,          <br>               estimator=&quot;ULS&quot;,           <br>               se=&quot;robust&quot;,             <br>               test=&quot;mean.var.adjusted&quot;,  <br>               se=&quot;bootstrap&quot;,          <br>               test=&quot;bootstrap&quot;))     <br></div><div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t have a dataset per se, as I am working with the pooled covariance matrix after multiple imputation using mice. </div><div><br></div><div>Any insight is much appreciated,</div><div>Kika</div></blockquote></div>"
