     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div>Jeremy, I will make my code reproducible (thanks for the link to the blog post)<div><br></div><div>I will also apply the as.matrix function and check the \r\n\r\ncfa.mi() function suggested by Shu.  I was not aware of that function and will probably allow me to work with a dataset, not just the matrix. </div><div><br></div><div>If needed, I will come back to you guys with progress and questions</div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Kika</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#999999\">___________________</font><br><font color=\"#999999\">Kika Bradford</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#999999\"><a href=\"tel:(406)%20880-7661\" value=\"+14068807661\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+1 (406) 880-7661</a><br>skype: aribira</font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
